| `scripts/query_corpus.py --root` | string | `None` | an existing directory, never with `--corpus` | `scripts/query_corpus.py` | the checkout whose `wiki/corpus.json` is read and whose files are read for the level each states now (default: the project this script ships in); an empty one, or one that does not exist, is refused with exit 2, and one with no corpus prints `[]` with stderr naming where the corpus would be | building the corpus: `scripts/jobs/build_corpus.py` | always |
